  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving access to commercial networks for aquaculture- related businesses in East Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract aims to stimulate a more competitive regional aquaculture industry, particularly in Kenya, Tanzania and Uganda, supporting the development of stronger business links between regional and with international commercial aquaculture related businesses, strengthening trade and investment support services as well as facilitating investment and business scale-up. The following are the results to be achieved by the contractor: 1) Support the Lake Victoria Fisheries Organisation (LVFO) and regional aquaculture associations in the emergence of an East African Aquaculture Exhibition and Conference; 2) Facilitate flow of increased investment through connecting regional aquaculture companies to individual and institutional investors and funding sources; 3) Support regional aquaculture associations to develop and execute effective Business to Business and study tour programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
